batch and these two from the earlier

00:04:52.680 --> 00:04:57.210
one. I'll keep these images as location
references for the generation.

00:04:57.240 --> 00:05:02.250
Choose places you'd actually want to film
in.

00:05:03.920 --> 00:05:06.280
Now I'll upload all the assets for the
shoot.

00:05:06.280 --> 00:05:10.630
The three location images, her character
sheet, and the prepared product

00:05:10.640 --> 00:05:12.420
photo from the lesson files.

00:05:12.420 --> 00:05:17.720
Now, let's use the skill. I type a slash,
search for product, and choose the

00:05:17.720 --> 00:05:22.260
first one. This skill helps work out the
lighting and compositions.

00:05:22.260 --> 00:05:24.160
I'll tell it what kind of shoot I want.

00:05:24.160 --> 00:05:27.180
If you have a more specific idea, add it
here.

00:05:27.180 --> 00:05:31.170
If you skip the casting, leave out the
actress and ask for product-only

00:05:31.200 --> 00:05:36.240
shots. I type, make a cool photo shoot for
these sunglasses with our girl in

00:05:36.240 --> 00:05:38.460
