00:05:42.480 --> 00:05:45.230
Make them vertical, nine by 16.

00:05:45.240 --> 00:05:49.980
I check the mix, three photos with her and
three of just the glasses.

00:05:49.980 --> 00:05:54.000
I look at how the shots vary and whether
they show the glasses clearly.

00:05:54.000 --> 00:05:58.660
I check that all six are vertical and use
